# Build context for demos/repo-doctor/Dockerfile (the repository root): only what the Repo Doctor build reads.
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!libraries/protocol/**
!libraries/sdk/**
!libraries/github-theme/**
!demos/repo-doctor/**
!deployments/azure/**
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.data
**/test
# The sample project's tests are part of the sample, uploaded into sandboxes.
!demos/repo-doctor/sample/test
!demos/repo-doctor/sample/test/**
demos/repo-doctor/docs
deployments/azure/hosting
deployments/azure/sandbox
